<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>Pages on My New Hugo Project</title><link>https://miyanou.github.io/page/</link><description>Recent content in Pages on My New Hugo Project</description><generator>Hugo -- gohugo.io</generator><language>en-us</language><lastBuildDate>Mon, 26 Jan 2026 00:00:00 +0000</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://miyanou.github.io/page/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>About</title><link>https://miyanou.github.io/page/about/</link><pubDate>Mon, 26 Jan 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://miyanou.github.io/page/about/</guid><description>&lt;h2 id="who-is-this-for"&gt;Who is this for?&#10;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;This is a sample &lt;strong&gt;About&lt;/strong&gt; page. You can use it to introduce yourself, your blog, or your project.&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;h2 id="about-the-author"&gt;About the Author&#10;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;Hello! I&amp;rsquo;m a passionate blogger and open-source enthusiast. I love exploring new technologies and sharing my experiences with the community.&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;h3 id="my-journey"&gt;My Journey&#10;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;I started my journey in web development over 10 years ago. Since then, I&amp;rsquo;ve worked on numerous projects ranging from small personal blogs to large-scale enterprise applications.&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;h3 id="skills"&gt;Skills&#10;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&#10;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Front-end&lt;/strong&gt;: HTML, CSS, JavaScript, React, Vue&lt;/li&gt;&#10;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Back-end&lt;/strong&gt;: Node.js, Python, Go&lt;/li&gt;&#10;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Tools&lt;/strong&gt;: Git, Docker, Hugo, Neovim&lt;/li&gt;&#10;&lt;/ul&gt;&#10;&lt;h2 id="contact-me"&gt;Contact Me&#10;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;Feel free to reach out if you have any questions or just want to say hi!&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;ul&gt;&#10;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Email&lt;/strong&gt;: &lt;a class="link" href="mailto:hello@example.com" &gt;hello@example.com&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#10;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Twitter&lt;/strong&gt;: &lt;a class="link" href="https://twitter.com/example" target="_blank" rel="noopener"&#10; &gt;@example&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#10;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;GitHub&lt;/strong&gt;: &lt;a class="link" href="https://github.com/example" target="_blank" rel="noopener"&#10; &gt;example&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#10;&lt;/ul&gt;&#10;&lt;hr&gt;&#10;&#10; &lt;blockquote&gt;&#10; &lt;p&gt;&amp;ldquo;Logic will get you from A to B. Imagination will take you everywhere.&amp;rdquo;&lt;br&gt;&#10;— &lt;em&gt;Albert Einstein&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&#10; &lt;/blockquote&gt;&#10;&lt;hr&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;This page was generated by AI.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#10;</description></item><item><title>Archives</title><link>https://miyanou.github.io/page/archives/</link><pubDate>Tue, 28 May 2019 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://miyanou.github.io/page/archives/</guid><description/></item><item><title>Links</title><link>https://miyanou.github.io/page/links/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://miyanou.github.io/page/links/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;To use this feature, add &lt;code&gt;links&lt;/code&gt; section to frontmatter.&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;This page&amp;rsquo;s frontmatter:&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" style="color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;-webkit-text-size-adjust:none;"&gt;&lt;code class="language-yaml" data-lang="yaml"&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;links&lt;/span&gt;:&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; - &lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;title&lt;/span&gt;: &lt;span style="color:#ae81ff"&gt;GitHub&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;description&lt;/span&gt;: &lt;span style="color:#ae81ff"&gt;GitHub is the world&amp;#39;s largest software development platform.&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;website&lt;/span&gt;: &lt;span style="color:#ae81ff"&gt;https://github.com&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;image&lt;/span&gt;: &lt;span style="color:#ae81ff"&gt;https://github.githubassets.com/images/modules/logos_page/GitHub-Mark.png&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; - &lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;title&lt;/span&gt;: &lt;span style="color:#ae81ff"&gt;TypeScript&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;description&lt;/span&gt;: &lt;span style="color:#ae81ff"&gt;TypeScript is a typed superset of JavaScript that compiles to plain JavaScript.&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;website&lt;/span&gt;: &lt;span style="color:#ae81ff"&gt;https://www.typescriptlang.org&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;image&lt;/span&gt;: &lt;span style="color:#ae81ff"&gt;ts-logo-128.jpg&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;code&gt;image&lt;/code&gt; field accepts both local and external images.&lt;/p&gt;&#10;</description></item><item><title>Search</title><link>https://miyanou.github.io/page/search/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://miyanou.github.io/page/search/</guid><description/></item></channel></rss>